# Where the Own app gets real data (services/api, the /v1/owner surface).
#
# Unset: the app runs on its demonstration portfolio (requirements §9.6) —
# no network, no side effects, clearly fictional people.
#
# Local development against the API on this machine:
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8080
# (run the API per SETUP_LOCAL.md; with AUTH_ENFORCE=false it impersonates
# DEV_IMPERSONATE_ORG, so what the app shows is that organisation's rows)
#
# Copy to .env and fill in; .env is gitignored, this file is the record.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
